The ReSTIR story's neighbour's W at P
=====================================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) for chapter 6's beat `c6-source-math`, stage by stage as
its stage (`stepOf "source" 5`, the clips below) goes from 0 to 5: in the math scenes' example world (examples.rs, the lab's illustration), Q's target
and P's over the 24 lights, each as the chance RIS ends on a light (its share of the target, the limit of many
candidates); Q's sample, the one Q's reservoir keeps in the combining beat's example; W, standing in for one over
that chance; why its mean must be exact (an estimate too bright or too dark); and that chance at P, so Q's W is not
the one P needs.

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]
$[Import* paper_restir_common]

The example

The combining beat's example (script/combine.lam), whose Q's reservoir keeps the sample shown here.
$[# _seed 13]
$[# _count 32]
The size of the formulas, and where they go.
$[# _size 0.44]
$[# _rightX 3.9]
The two rows of bars: Q's above, P's below.
$[# _qBox [% {box {v2 -6.6 0.7} {v2 0.2 2.6}}]]
$[# _pBox [% {box {v2 -6.6 -2.5} {v2 0.2 -0.6}}]]

Fn([List(Float)], List(Float)). Each light's share of the target (the chance RIS ends on it, as candidates grow).
$[# {_chances brings} [# total {fold brings 0.0 +}] {map brings {^ {b} {over b total}}}]

Fn([String, List(Float), Box, Color, Int, Float], List(Mob)). A row of bars, one per light, the sample's bar lit
and the rest dimmed by `dim`.
$[# {_row id chances b color y dim}
    [# top {fold chances 0.000001 max}]
    [# bars {bars id chances top b {' color} 0.25}]
    {flatten {map
        {range 0 {length bars}}
        {^ {i} {!if {= i y} {tinted {nth bars i} accentColor} {faded {nth bars i} dim}}}}}]

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). Why W's mean must be exact (stage 3 to 4): the estimate on a number line, at the true
total when W is one over the chance, and too dark or too bright when W is too small or too large.
$[# {_scale s}
    [# a {v2 {- _rightX 2.6} -1.6}]
    [# b {v2 {+ _rightX 2.6} -1.6}]
    [# exact {lerp2 a b 0.5}]
    [# swing {* 0.3 {sin {* 6.2831853 {phase s 3.4 4.0}}}}]
    [# at {lerp2 a b {+ 0.5 swing}}]
    {flatten {'
        {line "scale" a b textDimColor 2.0}
        {line "exactTick" {add2 exact {v2 0.0 -0.15}} {add2 exact {v2 0.0 0.15}} totalColor 3.0}
        {moveTo
            {caption "exactNote" {textKey "sourcemath-exact"} 0.32 totalColor}
            {add2 exact {v2 0.0 -0.45}}}
        {moveTo
            {caption "darkNote" {textKey "sourcemath-dark"} 0.32 textDimColor}
            {add2 a {v2 0.6 0.45}}}
        {moveTo
            {caption "brightNote" {textKey "sourcemath-bright"} 0.32 textDimColor}
            {add2 b {v2 -0.6 0.45}}}
        {dotAt "estimate" at 0.1 estimateColor}}}]

The scene

Fn([], Score). A neighbour's W at P as a score of 5 steps: Q's chances over its lights and the sample among them,
W and its mean, what Q's W comes to, why the mean must be exact, and what P would need.
$[# {_score}
    [# q {_chances {map {exampleLights 1 0.0 1.0} .brings}}]
    [# p {_chances {map {exampleLights 0 0.0 1.0} .brings}}]
    [# y {.light {nth {.sources {exampleCombine _seed _count}} 1}}]
    [# pq {nth q y}]
    [# pp {nth p y}]
    [# name f"{\ell_{${str {+ y 1}}}}"]
    [# {_qRow dim} {_row "q" q _qBox targetColor y dim}]
    [# notes {append
        {moveTo {caption "qNote" {textKey "lightsmath-pixel-q"} 0.32 textDimColor} {v2 -3.2 3.0}}
        {moveTo {caption "pNote" {textKey "lightsmath-pixel-p"} 0.32 textDimColor} {v2 -3.2 -0.2}}}]
    [# yBar {boxOf {withId {_qRow 1.0} f"{q.${str y}}"}}]
    [# sample {append
        {moveTo
            {caption "sampleNote" {textKey "sourcemath-sample"} 0.32 accentColor}
            {v2 {.x {boxCenter yBar}} {+ {.y {.hi yBar}} 0.3}}}
        {moveTo
            {tex "sampleY" name 0.42 accentColor}
            {v2 {.x {boxCenter yBar}} {+ {.y {.hi yBar}} 0.78}}}}]
    [# rule {moveTo
        {texParts "w" f"{\lit{1}{W} = \frac{\sum w_i}{M\,\hat p(y)}}" _size textColor
            {' "W"}
            {' estimateColor}}
        {v2 _rightX 2.4}}]
    [# mean {moveTo
        {texParts "w" f"{\lit{1}{\overline{W}} = \frac{1}{\lit{2}{p(y)}}}" _size textColor
            {' "W" "p"}
            {' estimateColor accentColor}}
        {v2 _rightX 2.4}}]
    [# atQ {moveTo
        {texParts "atQ" f"{\lit{1}{p_Q($name)} \approx \frac{\hat p_Q($name)}{\sum \hat p_Q} = \lit{2}{${numberLatex pq 3}}}" _size textColor
            {' "pQ" "pQv"}
            {' accentColor accentColor}}
        {v2 _rightX 1.1}}]
    [# wQ {moveTo
        {texParts "wQ" f"{\lit{1}{\overline{W}_Q} \approx \frac{1}{${numberLatex pq 3}} = \lit{2}{${short {over 1.0 pq}}}}" _size textColor
            {' "W" "Wv"}
            {' estimateColor estimateColor}}
        {v2 _rightX -0.1}}]
    [# atP {moveTo
        {texParts "atP" f"{\lit{1}{p_P($name)} \approx \frac{\hat p_P($name)}{\sum \hat p_P} = \lit{2}{${numberLatex pp 3}}}" _size textColor
            {' "pP" "pPv"}
            {' targetColor targetColor}}
        {v2 _rightX -1.3}}]
    [# needs {moveTo
        {texParts "needs" f"{\frac{1}{${numberLatex pp 3}} = \lit{1}{${short {over 1.0 pp}}} \ne \lit{2}{${short {over 1.0 pq}}}}" _size textColor
            {' "need" "have"}
            {' targetColor estimateColor}}
        {v2 _rightX -2.4}}]
    {score "source" 5
        {'
            {part "q"
                {^ {s} {_qRow {lerp 1.0 0.45 {smooth {phase s 0.5 0.9}}}}}
                {' {enterOver 0.0 0.4 growUp}}}
            {part "p" {^ {s} {_row "p" p _pBox targetColor y 0.45}} {' {enterOver 0.4 0.4 growUp}}}
            {part "notes" {^ {s} notes} {' {enterOver 0.0 0.3 fadeIn}}}
            {part "sample" {^ {s} sample} {' {enterOver 0.5 0.4 fadeIn}}}
            {part "w" {^ {s} rule} {' {enterOver 1.0 0.6 write} {becomeOver 2.0 0.5 {^ {s} mean}}}}
            {part "atQ" {^ {s} atQ} {' {enterOver 2.4 0.4 write}}}
            {part "wQ" {^ {s} wQ} {' {enterOver 2.7 0.3 write}}}
            {part "scale" _scale {' {enterOver 3.0 0.3 fadeIn} {exitOver 4.0 0.3 fadeOut}}}
            {part "atP"
                {^ {s} atP}
                {'
                    {enterOver 4.1 0.4 write}
                    {emphasize 4.6 5.0 {^ {t f} {pointParts t f {' "pP"} accentColor}}}}}
            {part "needs" {^ {s} needs} {' {enterOver 4.5 0.4 write}}}}
        {'}}]

The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). A neighbour's W at P at stage its stage (`stepOf "source" 5`, the clips below).
$[# sourceMath {: {^ {t} {playScore {_score}}} Math}]

Clips

The scene's steps as clips (lab/src/clip.rs): its demonstration's Play plays every step in order, a second each;
the story plays each over its sentence's words, and sets the scene back to a step where a beat starts.
$[# sourceSteps [% {stepsInOrder "source" 5}]]
$[# sourceAt0 [% {stepsAt "source" 5 0}]]
$[# sourceStep1 [% {stepClip "source" 1 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# sourceStep2 [% {stepClip "source" 2 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# sourceStep3 [% {stepClip "source" 3 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# sourceStep4 [% {stepClip "source" 4 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# sourceStep5 [% {stepClip "source" 5 0.0 1.0}]]
